oatThemeAccordionComponentTokensProvider"}],"title":"BlueCoatThemeAccordionComponentTokensProvider","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"A class which wraps all ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"component  tokens of accordions","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" for "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"accordions"}]},{"type":"text","text":" components."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Contains also references to semantic tokens providers so as to be able to use them to define the component tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This provider should be integrated as a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllAccordionComponentTokensProvider"},{"text":" implementation inside ","type":"text"},{"code":"MISOTheme","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" so as to provide","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"all tokens to the users. It helps users to override some of the tokens and assign them to an "},{"code":"MISOTheme","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation to use."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It implements also the protocol ","type":"text"},{"code":"AccordionComponentTokens","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"AccordionFaqComponentTokens","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so as to expose the component tokens for ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"accordions","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" through any "},{"code":"MISOTheme","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Accordions"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" components tokens are defined with semantic tokens spaces (from ","type":"text"},{"code":"AllSpaceSemanticTokensProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":")","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and sizes (from ","type":"text"},{"code":"AllSizeSemanticTokensProvider","